common={'episode_count':'For every family and matched-hard allocation independently, while budget>=12 draw E=DU(12,min(20,budget)); residual<12 moves to routine and is logged. E includes all motif/context rows. For all except N3 set M=E-2 and R=2. For N3 use V/K above and R=E-M (nonnegative for all E). This explicitly replaces Stage 15A count laws for this separate challenge only; original V4 counts remain untouched.',
 'subjects':'Within each unit, independently random-permute active eligible-for-scheduling subjects (activity status only, not target eligibility) for each recipe and cycle without replacement before reuse. Agents similarly cycle. Select counterparties without self-links. No checking observed eligibility or target to accept a subject. Later intervals may revisit subjects; dependent episodes stay in one unit cluster.',
 'context':'Use all four Stage 15A context roles at probability 1/4 each and its padding/timing rules. Context always uses ordinary BASE amounts including S4/H3. Interleaved activity is counted in the fixed episode budget. No deleted pre-onset events.',
 'time':'Independent episode start uniform among fitting scored intervals, integer microseconds; uniform motif times within the declared duration, sorted, with first/last at endpoints except explicit order-swaps. No time quota conditioned on labels. Emit before updating state. Temporal support can fail.',
 'amount_hierarchy':'Ordinary routine/history/context use BASE. Explicit challenge motif amount laws above override BASE for those recipes; use the identical law for their matched hard origins except declared historical anchoring, fraction or directional mechanisms. S3,A1,A2,A3 use BASE; N1/N2 use log-uniform USD30..500. All final values constrained to USD0.01..15000 by fresh numerical proposal rejection, then common Decimal half-up cents once. S4/H3 retain exact Stage 15A conditional mixture. For related amount vectors, reject/redraw the entire vector on numerical bound failure, never on a label. Independent shift applied before bounds and rounding: ordinary multiplication1.15, bounded Stage15A transform for S4/H3 only. No double shifting.',
 'prohibition':'No generator-to-evaluator calls, forced labels, copied rows, support-driven retries or seed selection. Schedule once before labels; keep every event. Numerical/accounting failures and support failures are different.'}
